.: Dear Kitty Knight,
	
	As a sign of my gratitude for your countless years of hard work, I humbly invite you to the Kibble Castle tomorrow to celebrate the anniversary of Kibble Kingdom. Thank you for keeping all citizens, no matter their status, safe from harm. You are truly a beacon of hope throughout all the kingdom and I admire your dedication. Also please do wear your finest set of armor, it is a special occasion of course! I look forward to your attendance at the castle tomorrow at noon, don’t be late!
	
	Signed Yours Truly,
	Tiger Princess
